}

This is a serious enforcement action. Your account data will be permanently deleted on the scheduled date.

We urge you to review our:
- Terms of Service: {termsUrl}
- Community Guidelines: {guidelinesUrl}

APPEALS PROCESS:
If you believe this enforcement decision was incorrect or unjustified, you have 30 days to submit an appeal to appeals@astraof.com from this email address.

In your appeal, please:
- Clearly explain why you believe the enforcement decision was incorrect or unjustified
- Provide any relevant evidence or context

A Astral Safety Team member will review your appeal and may cancel the pending deletion until a final verdict has been reached.

- Astral Safety Team

passkeyMigrationNotice.body:
Hello {username},

Astral has moved to {newDomain}. Existing passkeys created on {legacyDomain} cannot be reused on the new domain.

What you need to do:
1. Sign in at {loginUrl}
2. Open Settings > Security in Astral
3. Add a new passkey for {newDomain}

Your old passkeys on {legacyDomain} will keep working only during the migration window. We will retire the legacy domain after users have moved.

If you cannot remember your password, use the recovery flow before adding the new passkey.

Security settings: {securityUrl}

- Astral Team

passkeyResetNotice.body:
Hello {username},

Your legacy Astral passkeys were removed as part of the move to {newDomain}.

What you need to do now:
1. Sign in at {loginUrl}
2. If needed, reset your password at {forgotUrl}
3. Open Settings > Security and add a new passkey for {newDomain}

Security settings: {securityUrl}

If this was unexpected, contact support@astraof.com.

- Astral Team
